;; typing/ctype.ml (levels, unification, generalization, instances, expansion of abbreviations), typing/predef.ml and
;; typing/printtyp.ml (with out_type.ml and oprint.ml) that the core language needs (doc/ocaml/TYPER.md), whose notices
;; follow (LICENSE.md, "The OCaml Core System"):
